<section class="wrap py-16" data-collision>
  <h2 class="display text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem)]">A double-booked face is a refund.</h2>
  <p class="section-copy mt-4">
    A secondary face in Accra or Kumasi is about GH₵ 2,400 to 3,200 a month. Prime
    corridors clear GH₵ 8,000. Sell the same six months twice and you refund one client,
    reprint the other, and lose both for the next campaign.
  </p>
  <p class="section-copy mt-4">
    Drag the amber booking onto the held face. Arrow keys also move it.
  </p>

  <div class="collision-board mt-10">
    <p class="mono m-0 text-sm">ACC-001 · Face A</p>
    <p class="mt-1 mb-3 text-sm">1 Aug 2026 – 31 Jan 2027</p>
    <div class="collision-months mono text-xs" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>Aug</span><span>Sep</span><span>Oct</span><span>Nov</span><span>Dec</span><span>Jan</span>
    </div>
    <div class="track collision-track" data-track>
      <div class="bar-occupied collision-held" data-booked>
        Held
      </div>
      <div class="collision-draft" data-draft tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="Proposed booking" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100">
        New booking
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="collision-error" data-error></p>
  </div>
  <p class="section-copy mt-6">
    Not a toast. The insert never lands.
  </p>
</section>
